agraph","text":"ありがたいです***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............................"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばぶちゃんって本当に呼ぶんですか!?\nみなさんに呼ばないでっていったのに...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめですよ!!\n高校生だしっ。ねっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近よくいじりますね...笑\nとうとういじられキャラになってしまったぁぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/16/img_1375.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかん家のツリーchanです♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっわいい!!っっかわいい-----!!\n絨毯もかわいい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この季節、家族4人でご飯食べる時は\nこのツリーを眺めながらなんです^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛糸のオーナメントは\n元はシルバーのものなんです。\nママが編んだんだよ---\nすごすぎる*。＊°.,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさんに何おねだりしようかな^^\nこのツリーの下にプレゼント置いてくれるかなぁ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前ほめてくださって\nありがとうございました☆*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリカーね。おもしろいよね!!\n全然いやじゃないですよ-!!*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい:)\n久しぶりに......."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/16/im